<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SiGU - Bienvenido</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="w-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#190019] to-[#dfb6b2] flex items-center justify-center min-h-screen p-4">
    <div class="w-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#854f6c] to-[#dfb6b2] p-8 rounded-lg shadow-2xl shadow-black/60 w-full max-w-2xl">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center text-gray-50 mb-6">Panel de Control</h1>

        {{#successMessage}}
        <div class="bg-green-100 border border-green-400 text-green-700 px-4 py-3 rounded relative mb-4" role="alert">
            <span class="block sm:inline">{{successMessage}}</span>
        </div>
        {{/successMessage}}
        {{#errorMessage}}
        <div class="bg-red-100 border border-red-400 text-red-700 px-4 py-3 rounded relative mb-4" role="alert">
            <span class="block sm:inline">{{errorMessage}}</span>
        </div>
        {{/errorMessage}}

        {{#username}}
        <p class="text-xl text-center text-gray-50 mb-8">¡Bienvenido, <span class="font-semibold text-blue-600">{{username}}</span>!</p>
        {{/username}}
        {{^username}}
        <p class="text-xl text-center text-gray-50 mb-8">¡Bienvenido!</p>
        {{/username}}

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">
            <div class="w-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#190019] to-[#dfb6b2] p-8 rounded-lg shadow-lg w-full max-w-2xl">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-700 mb-3">Tu Perfil</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-50 mb-4">Gestiona la información de tu cuenta.</p>
                <a href="/profile" class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white py-2 px-4 rounded-md hover:bg-blue-700 transition duration-300">Ver Perfil</a>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#190019] to-[#dfb6b2] p-8 rounded-lg shadow-lg w-full max-w-2xl">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-pink-700 mb-3">Configuraciones</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-50 mb-4">Ajusta las preferencias de tu aplicación.</p>
                <a href="/settings" class="inline-block bg-pink-600 text-white py-2 px-4 rounded-md hover:bg-pink-900 transition duration-300">Configuración</a>
            </div>
            {{#isAdmin}}
            <div class="w-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#190019] to-[#dfb6b2] p-8 rounded-lg shadow-lg w-full max-w-2xl">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-orange-400 mb-3">Cargar un docente</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-50 mb-4">Gestionar el alta de un docente de la universidad.</p>
                <a href="/teacher/new" class="inline-block bg-orange-500 text-white py-2 px-4 rounded-md hover:bg-orange-700 transition duration-300">Cargar</a>
            </div>

            <div class="w-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#190019] to-[#dfb6b2] p-8 rounded-lg shadow-lg w-full max-w-2xl">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-yellow-400 mb-3">Asignar materia a docente</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-50 mb-4">Relacionar una materia con un docente del sistema.</p>
                <a href="/teacher/assign-materia" class="inline-block bg-yellow-500 text-white py-2 px-4 rounded-md hover:bg-yellow-700 transition duration-300">Asignar</a>
            </div>

            <div class="w-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#190019] to-[#dfb6b2] p-8 rounded-lg shadow-lg w-full max-w-2xl">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-400 mb-3">Cargar un estudiante</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-50 mb-4">Gestionar el alta de un alumno de la universidad.</p>
                <a href="/student/new" class="inline-block bg-green-500 text-white py-2 px-4 rounded-md hover:bg-green-700 transition duration-300">Cargar</a>
            </div>

            <div class="w-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#190019] to-[#dfb6b2] p-8 rounded-lg shadow-lg w-full max-w-2xl">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-400 mb-3">Cargar Secretario/a</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-50 mb-4">Gestionar el alta de personal administrativo.</p>
                <a href="/secretariaAcademica/new" class="inline-block bg-blue-500 text-white py-2 px-4 rounded-md hover:bg-blue-700 transition duration-300">Cargar</a>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#190019] to-[#dfb6b2] p-8 rounded-lg shadow-lg w-full max-w-2xl">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-purple-400 mb-3">Cargar Carrera y Plan</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-50 mb-4">Alta de nuevas carreras académicas y sus planes de estudio iniciales.</p>
                <a href="/carrera/new" class="inline-block bg-purple-600 text-white py-2 px-4 rounded-md hover:bg-purple-700 transition duration-300">Cargar</a>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#190019] to-[#dfb6b2] p-8 rounded-lg shadow-lg w-full max-w-2xl">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-400 mb-3">Cargar Materia</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-50 mb-4">Configurar nuevas asignaturas, asignación de cuatrimestres y régimen de correlatividades.</p>
                <a href="/materia/new" class="inline-block bg-green-600 text-white py-2 px-4 rounded-md hover:bg-green-700 transition duration-300">Cargar</a>
            </div>
            {{/isAdmin}}

            {{#isDocente}}
            <div class="w-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#190019] to-[#dfb6b2] p-8 rounded-lg shadow-lg w-full max-w-2xl">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-purple-400 mb-3">Mis Materias</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-50 mb-4">Gestioná tus materias: publicá anuncios, cargá notas y asigná aulas.</p>
                <a href="/docente/materias" class="inline-block bg-purple-600 text-white py-2 px-4 rounded-md hover:bg-purple-700 transition duration-300">Ver Materias</a>
            </div>
            {{/isDocente}}
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">
            <div class="w-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#190019] to-[#dfb6b2] p-8 rounded-lg shadow-lg w-full max-w-2xl">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#ccd0fc] mb-3">Plan de Estudios</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-50 mb-4">Visualizar la grilla completa de materias, regímenes de cursado y correlatividades por carrera.</p>
                <a href="/carrera/materias" class="inline-block bg-zinc-800 text-white py-2 px-4 rounded-md hover:bg-zinc-900 transition duration-300">Ver Grilla</a>
            </div>

        {{#isEstudiante}}
            <div class="w-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#190019] to-[#dfb6b2] p-8 rounded-lg shadow-lg w-full max-w-2xl">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-yellow-400 mb-3">Aula Virtual</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-50 mb-4">Mirá los anuncios de tus materias y confirmá tu asistencia a parciales.</p>
                <a href="/estudiante/aula-virtual" class="inline-block bg-yellow-500 text-white py-2 px-4 rounded-md hover:bg-yellow-600 transition duration-300">Entrar</a>
            </div>

            <div class="w-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#190019] to-[#dfb6b2] p-8 rounded-lg shadow-lg w-full max-w-2xl">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-400 mb-3">Inscripción a Materias</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-50 mb-4">Inscribite en las materias habilitadas para cursar según tu plan de estudios.</p>
                <a href="/estudiante/inscripcion/cursada" class="inline-block bg-green-600 text-white py-2 px-4 rounded-md hover:bg-green-700 transition duration-300">Inscribir Materias</a>
            </div>
            
            <div class="w-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#190019] to-[#dfb6b2] p-8 rounded-lg shadow-lg w-full max-w-2xl">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-400 mb-3">Inscripción a Exámenes</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-50 mb-4">Anotate para rendir exámenes finales en las materias que tenés regulares o libres.</p>
                <a href="/estudiante/inscripcion/examen" class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white py-2 px-4 rounded-md hover:bg-blue-700 transition duration-300">Inscribir Exámenes</a>
            </div>

            <a href="/estudiante/materias"
                class="block bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/15 border border-white/20
                rounded-xl p-6 transition-all duration-200 group">
                <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#ccd0fc]/20 flex items-center
                        justify-center text-xl shrink-0">
                        📚
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="text-[#ccd0fc] font-semibold text-lg mb-1
                           group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
                            Mis Materias
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-white/50 text-sm">
                            Consultá tu historial académico: estado y notas por materia.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </a>
            {{/isEstudiante}}
        </div> <div class="text-center mt-6">
            <a href="/logout" class="inline-block bg-red-600 text-white py-2 px-6 rounded-md hover:bg-red-700 transition duration-300 text-lg">Cerrar Sesión</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
